{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "獲得了活動基礎的２－Ｔ班同學的同意之後──", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「事情就是這樣，拜託大家了。」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": "ar3184", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以我和愛理為中心，正式展開了全校規模的連署活動。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為距離休業式沒剩幾天了，應該會很辛苦……」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係的。那麼我就負責３年級生，尋找願意協助我們的人。」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": "mu0303", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕！」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 213, "voice": "pn0094", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，小熊喵也一起喔！」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": "mu0304", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我負責１年級生。」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "sk0641", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就負責２年級其他的班級了，不過我這麼受歡迎，應該是沒問題。」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn0206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我去問問看學生會願不願意協助吧～」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "ht0252", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家各自確定了不同的方向，希望組成協力合作的體制。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我來問問老師們好了……啊啊，還有對學園長的保密。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": "mc0182", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然必須對那個人保密才行嗎？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，好像在打游擊戰一樣呢……在遞出連署前不保密的話，她好像會鬧脾氣。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": "mc0183", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想要突然遞出連署讓媽媽嚇一跳。不好意思這部分就麻煩妳了，八塚老師。」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": "ar3185", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，我知道了。我會加油的瀨名同學。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": "mc0184", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼連署用的紙本和準備各種用具就交給本人安潔吧～～♪」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學校方面，交給萬智老師。後援的工作則由安潔負責。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然了，班上的同學也答應會盡量空出時間協助我們──", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": "ar3186", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再次感謝大家！」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": "ar3187", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……怎麼說呢，感覺產生了信心。", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這全部都是因為想支持愛理的樣子。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是說啊～」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在前往印刷室途中，安潔雀躍地笑著說。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老實說，之前的她是那種根本不需要人出手幫忙的感覺。」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈……現在則是個傻傻的女孩子。」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學說的沒錯。」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……當時就那樣說出口了。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 209, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "根本沒有看場面氣氛。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是……不知道為什麼，胸口有一股亢奮感。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
